  "article": {
    "heading": "Watch the <span class=\"arc\">Rituals</span>.",
    "lead": "One short video for each Ritual. You ask on the right. The editor shows each step on the left. Every few Rituals, one shows something going wrong and how to get back on track. Those carry the same \"When it goes wrong\" tag as on the tutorials page.",
    "sections": [
      {
        "id": "legend",
        "heading": "How to read these videos",
        "legendFrom": true,
        "html": "<p>Every Ritual video uses the same few cues. Learn them once and the rest read themselves.</p>"
      },
      {
        "id": "read",
        "heading": "<span class=\"g\">⌖</span> Read my Blueprint",
        "html": "<div class=\"vid\">\n  <video controls preload=\"none\" poster=\"/video/tutorials/01-read.jpg\" aria-label=\"Read my Blueprint\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\">\n    <source src=\"/video/tutorials/01-read.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n    Your browser can't play this video. <a href=\"/video/tutorials/01-read.mp4\">Download it</a> or read the ritual instead.\n  </video>\n  <p class=\"vid-desc\">Understand an asset you've never seen.</p>\n  <p class=\"vid-link\"><a href=\"/docs/tutorials/#read\">Read the ritual →</a></p>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "id": "onboard",
        "heading": "<span class=\"g\">⊞</span> Onboard to a project you've never opened",
